WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:33.830
That's a lie!

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:36.310
My brother isn't trying to kill me!

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:41.420
Noei is an officer under the direct control of His Highness the Crown Prince Somand.

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.040
There is no room for doubt.

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:45.770
It's all a big lie.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.680
My brother would never do a stupid thing like that!

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:53.670
I'll ask you one last time.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:57.030
Did you plan this alone?

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.020
Yes.

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:04.770
You're saying you weren't under anyone's orders?

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:07.290
Yes.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.190
My younger brother...

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.980
Rumaty... kill him.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.820
Yes. The plot was mine alone.

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:28.290
The scabbard...

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:31.060
That's enough!

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.040
Nothing happened.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.020
This is over!

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.260
Rumaty!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.560
Stay out!

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:48.890
Rumaty...

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.710
No one can see...

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:55.970
The tears of the King's son...

00:02:56.820 --> 00:03:01.740
aren't something I can let anyone see...

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:16.950
"Promise"

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:25.960
Yes?

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.490
Ah, it's Miss Kajika.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.330
Is Rumaty up?

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.390
Yes, I carried his breakfast in a while ago.

00:03:33.800 --> 00:03:35.470
Did he eat anything this morning?

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:38.420
No... not really...

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:41.740
I thought not, so I made these...

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.030
Banana cupcakes!

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.600
You did this for His Highness?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.260
I'm sure he'll be delighted.

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:53.010
My nurse Maria taught me to make them...

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.120
they're really good!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.610
Sezun, what is it?

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.600
Brother...

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:02.000
Miss Kajika brought cupcakes for His Highness...

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.730
How kind of you...

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.060
we'll make sure he gets them.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.990
But... can't I see him?

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.410
Unfortunately...

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.450
His Highness is still a little under the weather...

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:18.240
I see...  there's nothing you can do, then...

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:21.090
Well then, Miss Kajika...

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.180
Hello? It's me.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.700
Yeah... are you clear?

00:04:47.490 --> 00:04:49.230
This is your last chance.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.820
Why didn't you let her in, brother?

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:56.040
You know what His Highness' moods are like.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:00.160
If we let her see him now, he'd end up throwing the cupcakes at her.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.430
She's Burnsworth's only daughter.

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:08.470
If she and His Highness aren't good friends, there will be problems down the line...

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.100
Well, then, I'll just...

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:12.730
That won't be necessary!

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.540
What are you thinking...

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:18.190
giving His Highness something made by an amateur?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.870
What? She made these especially for His Highness...

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:22.200
Sezun!

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:26.210
Let me explain to you the position His Highness is in.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:31.110
His Highness Rumaty is currently second in line for the throne.

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:35.850
But if sickly Crown Prince Somand met with some accident...

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:38.500
His Highness Rumaty would become King.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:42.180
And someone like that...

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:45.670
can't be receiving favors from a girl who's not even from Raginei...

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:50.830
We must be prepared for every scenario.

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.400
Brother, the way you're talking...

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:58.280
it's almost like you're sure an "accident" will happen to His Highness Somand...

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:02.350
Sezun... hurry and grow up.

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:05.370
For His Highness' sake.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:15.500
Enter.

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:18.820
2nd Lt. Noei, are you up?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.770
Oh, it's you.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.400
You don't have to get up.

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:26.040
My injury is nothing, really.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.830
Your doctor would be pretty mad if he heard you say that, Lieutenant.

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.850
You can stop calling me "Lieutenant."

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:35.060
I'm not a soldier anymore.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.560
Can I call you "Isaac," then?

00:06:39.910 --> 00:06:41.160
Sure.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:44.180
Is anything wrong?

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.150
You seem a bit down.

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.560
Very perceptive...

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:53.590
Rumaty won't see me.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.670
I thought we'd become friends.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.980
That was pretty self-important of me.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:07.130
No one can comfort His Highness right now.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:15.010
I know how Prince Rumaty adored Crown Prince Somand...

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:19.700
But the Crown Prince didn't understand that...

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:21.370
in the end...

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.380
Don't say a word.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.860
Say nothing, and kill Rumaty!

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:28.970
Your Highness!

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:30.660
I can't sleep at night!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:33.160
Those blue eyes cut right through me...

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:34.420
I'm scared of them...

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:38.390
And my younger brother, with the violent temper...

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.460
I'm scared of him...

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:45.430
Isaac... Isaac?

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.740
What's wrong?

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.170
Ah...

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.170
Sorry...

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.580
you just...

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:58.260
you look too much like His Highness Rumaty.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:00.280
Do I really?

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.070
I can't really see it, myself...

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:07.470
But you look like someone too, someone I knew.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.620
What kind of person?

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:11.880
A Doberman!

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:14.000
You mean... a dog?

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:16.680
Yeah, one of Dad's dogs...

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.750
jet black and huge!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:23.670
Since Mustafa's smell always clung to me...

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:26.180
most dogs were scared...

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:29.450
but this one kept his cool. He had guts.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.280
Mustafa?

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:33.410
The white leopard I loved.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:34.970
I see.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:39.270
Mustafa hated animals... that Doberman was the only one who ever interested him.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.400
He always stuck close to Dad, though...

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:45.460
so he couldn't be around me much...

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:49.690
Isaac...

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:52.420
Why not come to America...

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.640
to my house?

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.350
Instead of the Doberman?

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.250
But I'm just like that dog.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:05.660
I also have a master for life.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.290
I'm no one's master.

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:13.140
The Doberman and Mustafa were both my dear friends...

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.540
I loved them.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:19.910
Therefore I'd like to be friends with you, too.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.680
You're a strange girl...

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:28.520
Excuse me.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:29.700
May I?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.880
Lee-Leng...

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.390
I need a word with Mr. Noei.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:36.020
Well, I'll slip out then.

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:41.050
I'll be back later.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.570
Looks like she likes you.

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:49.270
She told me I looked like her old friend the Doberman.

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:51.940
Strangely enough, I don't mind.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.600
I guess it's her natural charm.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.950
Are you going to go to America?

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.530
I know how Kajika thinks...

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.250
There are deep ties between Raginei and the Burnsworth family.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:09.430
You'd probably like to be somewhere where you can stay informed.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.240
Also, there's Quinza...

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:15.480
He's probably a bit uneasy about letting me go completely.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:19.090
He'd be relieved to put me in a "Burnsworth" jail cell.

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:23.340
Maybe I could be useful as a witness, if things get serious.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:28.040
You're much more than a simple soldier, aren't you.

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:31.060
You catch on very quickly.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.620
Will you go quietly to jail?

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.380
I'll go.

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.000
Rumaty!

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.620
I came to say goodbye.

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:50.360
I'm going back to my country.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.430
--When?
--Tonight.

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:55.550
So suddenly?

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:57.780
I have to see my older brother...

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.930
This time, whoever tries to stop me...

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:04.880
You can't see your brother freely?

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.750
Brother and I live in different palaces.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:11.230
The palace of the Queen and Crown Prince...

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:14.400
is off-limits without the approval of the Prince's Head Chamberlain.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.490
I see... so then...

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:19.740
you can't see your mother freely, either?

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:23.670
My mother passed away not long after I was born.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.830
I don't remember my mother, either...

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:32.070
she died when I was two years old.

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:35.670
Rumaty, your eyes are red...

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:39.650
I--I haven't slept well, these last two days.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:42.670
Rumaty!

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:44.950
We're friends, aren't we?

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:48.230
Why won't you share even the smallest complaint with me?

00:11:49.240 --> 00:11:51.590
Can't you trust me that much?

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:53.500
It doesn't matter what it is...

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.830
I want to be someone you rely on.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:59.260
I want to, but I can't do anything, and it's frustrating!

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.640
I'm lonely...

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:05.800
Soft...

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.650
Why is it so soft?

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:12.080
I've never felt anything like it before.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:27.630
Ah--S--sorry...! I d--didn't mean...

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:34.570
Great! You're feeling better!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.320
I'm so glad my hands were helpful.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:40.460
If it's this good, you can touch me any time!

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:45.710
By the way...

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:46.820
Hm?

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.440
I know it's your brother, but...

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.250
you'd better not rush into anything.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:52.760
I don't understand the whole situation...

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:55.760
but there are too many people in between you two.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.870
Whenever it goes through a third party...

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:03.290
the truth will always be warped. That's what my dad says.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:07.240
The only thing to do is talk frankly with him face-to-face.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:09.500
I think so, too.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:13.960
When I got to see my brother before I left, he was kind to me.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:17.270
Yeah, it must be some kind of misunderstanding!

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.230
It must be!

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:22.530
No one would try to kill his own baby brother.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.870
Tonight...

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:37.230
W--when I turn eighteen...

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.190
I'll be studying abroad.

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:41.510
Studying abroad?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.170
Oxford University.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.850
Go to the same college as me!

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.460
I wonder if I can get in... it seems pretty tough...

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.590
Do you get bad grades?

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:54.800
I think they're not bad, but...

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.830
I've always been tutored, so I don't know how I rank.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.610
I never worried about it...

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:03.370
Hm... come to think of it, same for me.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:07.980
Excuse me.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.650
Are those strawberries?

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.360
Master Lee-Leng asked me to bring them over.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.060
Lee-Leng? That's weird...

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:20.630
he always gets mad when I eat between meals.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.750
What?

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:30.090
Wait! Don't eat that! Kajika!

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.040
Hey, lady!

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.770
Wait!

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:38.950
If anyone's out there... she's an assassin! Don't let her escape!

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:40.780
Hold it right there!

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:42.960
Stop...

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.200
please don't kill me...

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:46.530
I only did what they asked!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.210
They just said, "Get into the house and serve strawberries!"

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.120
Her target was Kajika!

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:53.040
What!?

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:56.790
Hey! Who sent you!?

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.910
Toranosuke, we won't have violence here.

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:03.760
Master Lee-Leng...

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:09.430
Don't worry. We won't hurt you.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:12.810
You just wanted some money, right?

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:16.210
Wh--who are you?

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:17.840
I'm in charge here.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.730
As it stands, you'll be charged with attempted murder.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.590
If you were to cooperate, though...

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.630
I'll do it! I'll cooperate!

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:30.810
Well then... tell me the name of the person who sent you.

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:33.440
Someone I know from the slums...

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.060
but he said he was following orders, too!

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:38.410
Fine. Toranosuke...

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:40.740
go with her and track the guy down.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.180
Ah... right.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:45.520
Now. I have one more question.

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.460
Answer this for me...

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.430
O--okay.

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:51.350
How did you get in here?

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:52.970
He said, at exactly ten o'clock...

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.650
Security would go down for just 30 seconds.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.710
Someone on the inside...?

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:04.680
I'll take this matter...

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:06.230
into my own hands.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.950
Lee-Leng...

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.570
What are you doing?

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:22.670
Work.

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:27.120
Has Toranosuke come back?

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:29.900
A while ago. He uncovered the culprit, too.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:31.590
Who?

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:33.020
Leon Wie.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:34.570
You can stop worrying.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.290
We drove him out of Hong Kong.

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:37.950
That's not it...

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:40.220
there's still someone behind him.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:42.320
Do you want to know?

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.790
No... I just...

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.940
what are you going to do with the person?

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.810
They should be punished, shouldn't they?

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:57.830
Lee-Leng... sometimes you get a scary look on your face...

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:01.340
you stop being the Lee-Leng I know.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.780
But... when you look like that...

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:07.740
it always has something to do with me.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:10.050
If I'm the one...

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.830
making you do that...

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:13.340
I'll be sad...

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:16.550
Are you afraid of me?

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:23.190
Why would I be afraid of you?

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:28.440
Well, it's almost time for His Highness to leave.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.570
You should say goodbye.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:32.790
Yeah.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:35.150
I'll be there in a moment.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:36.580
Okay.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:48.890
I thought you'd come.

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:53.260
You're completely soft when it comes to that girl.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.540
I can't stand watching...

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:58.230
the look on your face when you look at her...

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:01.920
If you love her that much, go ahead and propose!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.880
If you asked Burnsworth's consent, you'd get it, right?

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:09.310
If the world were as simple as you are, I would.

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:11.320
What are you saying?

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:15.330
That's not what you wanted to hear, is it?

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.770
I knew you were a fool...

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:22.440
but you're worse than I ever knew.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.560
The kind of devil woman...

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:26.630
who's motivated by money and loves only herself...

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:29.220
is much easier to deal with.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:33.840
I thought you fit the stereotype, too, but...

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.800
Lee-Leng... I...

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:38.200
I guess I can't get conceited...

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:40.440
my true feelings for you...

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.090
there's a lot I still don't understand.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:47.190
Lee-Leng!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.130
Please...

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:51.420
Forgive me! Lee-Leng...

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.470
Bridget...

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:00.570
I'll give you an hour.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:05.920
During that time, think about your future plans.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:12.870
After one hour...

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:15.250
you won't get any more soft words.

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.290
But...

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:19.650
I was somewhat fond...

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:23.290
of your foolish parts.

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:26.140
Farewell.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:28.210
Rumaty!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:30.990
Kajika!

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.660
Did you find out who made the attempt on your life?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.070
I'll be fine.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.390
Lee-Leng is by my side!

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:38.980
That guy?

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.910
He gives me the creeps, but he seems reliable...

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:45.450
Rumaty, look at the second window on the third floor...

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.210
What is it? I see someone's shadow...

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:50.850
It's Isaac.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.870
He's secretly seeing you off...

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:56.230
We're going to take care of him at my house in America.

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.780
If you give your permission, tell me!

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:01.310
Hmph... none of my business.

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:04.970
--Sezun.
--Ah--yes?

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:08.290
I know that, when you were schoolchildren...

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.490
he took care of timid little you...

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:14.310
I also understand that you love him like a brother even today...

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:17.070
Brother...

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:18.800
But don't forget...

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:21.630
your real brother is right here.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:25.300
Noei is a useful sacrificial pawn.

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:28.800
He'll come in handy someday for His Highness' sake.

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.500
If you are my younger brother...

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:33.420
you'll get rid of all this sympathy.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:37.710
This is a charm from the island where I was raised.

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.700
It's made from the shell of a sea turtle.

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:43.520
I'm sure... it will protect you.

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.930
Huh... can a prince even wear something like this?

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:52.150
You're finally back to your old self... it's okay if you don't wear it.

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:55.720
I--I'll wear it under my clothes...

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.430
Rumaty...

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:06.200
It's a friendship promise...

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.840
Give me one, too...

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:22.600
From now on, whatever happens...

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.960
we will be friends.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:27.570
Even if the whole world turns against you...

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.950
I'll be on your side...

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.450
I promise...

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.910
Okay. It's a promise.

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:51.250
Master Lee-Leng...

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.470
Ms. Bridget has fled.

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:55.820
Shall we confirm her destination?

00:21:56.030 --> 00:21:58.470
It doesn't matter... leave her alone.

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:00.960
That little fool...

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:03.760
Uncle, keep your chin up.

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:06.570
I know a girl who looks a lot like Bridget...

00:22:07.270 --> 00:22:09.100
I'll introduce you someday.

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:12.430
You say some cruel things sometimes...

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:24.710
Your Highness...

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:26.340
I've brought you your tea.

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:29.830
What's that?

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:31.850
A present from a friend...

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:34.820
It's a dumb little thing... but I'm wearing it...

00:22:35.100 --> 00:22:36.290
That must be...

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:38.380
an especially bold school friend.

00:22:38.610 --> 00:22:40.710
Who on Earth is his father?

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.710
What are you asking me?

00:22:42.910 --> 00:22:45.390
A school friend isn't called "a friend."

00:22:46.660 --> 00:22:48.130
Your Highness...

00:22:50.110 --> 00:22:53.360
I got this... from a real friend!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
